se-list-XML/issues/2560#issuecomment-2458136271","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2560","id":2458136271,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86ShC7P","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-05T20:56:41Z","updated_at":"2024-11-05T20:56:41Z","body":"I don't think I'd view \"you may not license this under the GPL\" as a restriction. At least, not one in the sense of \"use restrictions\" we usually talk about. Arguably any GPL-incompatible license (e.g. Apache-2.0 or CDDL-1.1, if you believe they aren't GPL-compatible) cannot be licensed under the GPL, but would still be \"open source\" licenses.\r\n\r\n(Arguably _any_ software under most non-GPL licenses cannot be simply \"license[d]... under the GPL\", but that's a rabbit hole I don't really want to go down here.)  :)\r\n\r\nI view this as being roughly comparable to [Beerware](https://spdx.org/licenses/Beerware.html) (which it feels like it might've been based on). I'd be +1 to add it to the list given this and its inclusion in Fedora.\r\n\r\nFrom a quick search I don't see this showing up in anything other than this wwl package. I'd be fine with `wwl` as the ID (probably lowercase, as that's how it appears to be rendered in the project?) and \"wwl License\" as the full name.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2458136271/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2477065438","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2560#issuecomment-2477065438","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2560","id":2477065438,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86TpQTe","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-14T17:54:38Z","updated_at":"2024-11-14T17:54:38Z","body":"also used in Debian, see https://sources.debian.org/src/wwl/1.3%2Bdb-3/wwl.c/\r\nand likely in FreeBSD, given the email address\r\n\r\n+1 to add as well, agree with @swinslow 's analysis","author